#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "Pardon me, miss. Did I hear you're having money trouble?"
msgstr "Disculpe... ¿escuché que tenía problemas financieros?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "128_Financially Troubled Woman"
msgid "And who are you? Not another debt collector, I hope!"
msgstr "¿Y tú quién eres? ¡¿Acaso también vienes a cobrarme deudas?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "No, not at all. But I am in the same line of business as\\r\nthat other fellow."
msgstr "No, para nada. Pero estoy en el mismo negocio que ese otro tipo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "152_Financially Troubled Woman"
msgid "A moneylender!? Then, I'd like to apply for a loan!"
msgstr "¡¿Un prestamista?! Entonces, ¡me gustaría solicitar un préstamo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "164_Financially Troubled Woman"
msgid "...Oh, but why bother? It's no use."
msgstr "...Aunque de seguro no es posible. Al menos no para mí."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "176_Akiyama"
msgid "It sounds like they've got you blacklisted, is that right?\\r\nHow much do you owe?"
msgstr "Parece que te tienen en la lista negra. ¿Cuánto es lo que debes ahora mismo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "188_Financially Troubled Woman"
msgid "...I'd say about ten million or so."
msgstr "...Diría que unos diez millones, más o menos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "200_Akiyama"
msgid "\"About\"? So you don't even know how much you borrowed?"
msgstr "¿\"Más o menos\"? ¿Entonces no sabes cuánto pediste prestado?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "212_Financially Troubled Woman"
msgid "Loan sharks, credit cards－you name it, I've borrowed money\\r\nfrom it... What are you getting at?"
msgstr "Prestamistas, tarjetas de crédito... Tengo deudas por todos lados... ¿Adónde quieres llegar con esto?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "224_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, it's just that you put on a brave face for somebody so\\r\ndeep in debt. Nice clothes and all that... It made me\\r\nwonder."
msgstr "Bueno, para alguien con tantas deudas, tienes mucha confianza. Además, te vistes bien... Por eso me llamaste la atención."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "236_Financially Troubled Woman"
msgid "What's the point in looking all pitiful just because I\\r\nhappen to owe some people money? This is how I live, after\\r\nall."
msgstr "¿Por qué debería parecer miserable solo porque tengo algunas deudas? Este es mi estilo de vida."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "I see... You're something else, you know that? You've\\r\ncertainly caught my attention."
msgstr "Ya veo, ya veo.... eres muy especial. Definitivamente me pareces interesante."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "260_Financially Troubled Woman"
msgid "Are you hitting on me?"
msgstr "¿Estás intentando coquetear conmigo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "272_Akiyama"
msgid "No, it's not that. Look, if you're truly ready to make a\\r\nfresh start, come to my office. Sky Finance, on Tenkaichi\\r\nStreet."
msgstr "No, no es eso. Mira, si estás realmente lista para comenzar de nuevo, ven a mi oficina. Sky Finance, en la calle Tenkaichi."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "284_Financially Troubled Woman"
msgid "Sky Finance? I've heard rumors..."
msgstr "¿Sky Finance...? He escuchado rumores..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "My name is Shun Akiyama. And you are?"
msgstr "Me llamo Shun Akiyama. ¿Y tú eres?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "308_Shoko"
msgid "Me...? I'm Shoko Muto."
msgstr "¿Yo...? Me llamo Shoko Muto."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, then, Shoko-san, I hope you'll decide to pay me a\\r\nvisit."
msgstr "Un gusto, Shoko-san. Cuando te apetezca, ven a visitarnos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "332_Shoko"
msgid "...Goodbye."
msgstr "...Adiós."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "392_Akiyama"
msgid "(Shoko Muto... I have a feeling I'll see her sooner or later.)"
msgstr "(Shoko Muto... tengo la sensación de que aparecerá pronto por la oficina)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "404_Akiyama"
msgid "(In fact, she might already be on her way. Maybe I ought to head over to the office and see...)"
msgstr "(De hecho, es posible que ya esté en camino. ¿Debería ir de una vez?)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "428_Financially Troubled Woman"
msgid "I don't want a loan from you anyway! You're not the only\\r\noffice in Kamurocho, you know."
msgstr "¡Como sea, no quiero un préstamo suyo! ¡¡Hay muchas otras oficinas en Kamurocho!!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "440_Loan Shark"
msgid "That's not the point. You've been blacklisted. There's not\\r\na loan shark in town who'd lend to you now."
msgstr "...Sabes que nadie hará negocios contigo. Estás en la lista negra. No hay prestamista en la ciudad que te quiera prestar dinero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "452_Financially Troubled Woman"
msgid "You don't know that for sure! I'm never doing business\\r\nwith you ever again!"
msgstr "¡¿Y tú cómo estás tan seguro de eso?! ¡Nunca volveré a hacer negocios con ustedes!"

